    "1 Unlimited line: New Xfinity Mobile customers only. Requires residential post-pay 300 Mbps internet or above. New Unlimited mobile line must be purchased within 90 days. $25 one-time activation fee/line applies. Discount limited to the value of one Unlimited line applied via 12 monthly bill credits. Tablet and smart watch lines are not eligible for these discounts. $25/mo charge applies if Xfinity TV, Voice or internet not maintained. After 1 year, taxes and fees, and other applicable charges extra, and subj. to change. Reduced speeds after 30GB of usage/line. Data thresholds may vary. For Xfinity Mobile Broadband Disclosures visit: www.xfinity.com/mobile/policies/broadband-disclosures.",
    "Smartwatch discount: Limited to Xfinity Gold, Diamond, and Platinum members with account in good standing. $299.99 off for Diamond and Platinum members, $150 off for Gold members. Must enter unique offer code during checkout to receive discount. Requires Xfinity Mobile, purchase and activation of new, eligible smartwatch while supplies last, a 36-month Xfinity Mobile Device Payment Plan Agreement (\"Device Agreement\"), and activation of new Xfinity Mobile watch line within 30 days of device purchase date. Additional $10 monthly smartwatch fee applies. Tax on pre-credit price and fees extra. Up to $299.99 in bill credits applied monthly so long as Device Agreement is in effect. If line is canceled or watch payments are accelerated, remaining credits are forfeited. One code per member account/household; max two transactions per code. Not valid with prior purchases, returns or exchanges. Back orders are eligible. Out of stock watches are not eligible. May not be combined with other device offers.",
